Optional bounded Context::Update bucket timings for RmlUi. Disabled by default;
no clock reads or logs occur unless MP6_RML_UPDATE_TIMINGS=1 is present before
the first update. Reports 600 Update calls at a time through the registered
Rml log interface. The buckets preserve Context::Update's original call order:
prelude (locale/reset/scroll), hover, data models, recursive root update,
document layout/position, and deferred document release.

--- a/Source/Core/Context.cpp
+++ b/Source/Core/Context.cpp
@@ -17,7 +17,10 @@
